/// What a verifier concluded about one assessment. standing holds the three axes apart (outcome from the manifest, integrity and applicability judged here); checks lists every check apart; trusted_keys are the reader's keys that verified a required signature; status_source names the status the verifier used (absent: none); anchors are the digests of the anchors it used; verifier names the verifier and its version; limits says what verification does not show. Verification does not rerun the assessment and does not judge whether its findings are true.
